=2 Walkthrough
* Zone in and out if you just completed {q:Blast from the Past|Blast from the Past|Blast from the Past}.
* Speak to {p:Koru-Moru} to begin the quest.
** **(Optional)**: Talk to {n:Bonchacha} and {n:Maan-Pokuun} for some hints.
** **(Optional)**: Speak to {p:Yoran-Oran} (E-5) to discuss the author of the thesis on alchemy.
** **(Optional)**: Speak to {p:Shantotto} (K-7) to discuss alchemy.
* Speak to {n:Fuepepe} in {z:Windurst Waters} North (L-6).
* Go north to the **Acolyte Hostel** (K-6). Interact with each of the six doors on the ground floor and you'll play **Quiz de Vana'diel**. Answer a question correctly and go to another door until you have 4 to 6 correct answers. **(See table at the bottom of this page.)**
* After answering the questions, head to the western **Acolyte Hostel** building at (K-5) for a cutscene.
* You will receive the {@k} {k:Thesis on alchemy}.
** If you answered all 6 questions correctly, you'll additionally be rewarded a {i:Vile Elixir|Vile Elixir|4174}.
*** If you already have a {i:Vile Elixir|Vile Elixir|4174} and should receive one, you won't be able to complete the quest. Dispose of your existing Vile Elixir, then click on the door again to continue the quest/receive the cut-scene.
** If you answered 4 questions correctly, the quest will continue (but you will not receive an Elixir).
* Return to Koru-Moru for a cut-scene.
* Trade Koru-Moru a {i:Cold Bone|Cold Bone|907} and {i:Warm Egg|Warm Egg|4602} for a cut-scene.
** {i:Cold Bone|Cold Bone|907} can be purchased from the {z:Auction House} ({@g:Auction House} > Materials > Bonecraft) or farmed by killing {m:Doom Soldier} (**{p:U|Uncommon (10%)}**) that spawn at nighttime in {z:Cape Teriggan}. It is believed that the Doom Mages and Doom Soldiers share spawns with the goblins in the area, kill goblins at night to get Doom Soldier to spawn.
** {i:Warm Egg|Warm Egg|4602} can be purchased from the {z:Auction House} ({@g:Auction House} > Food > Ingredients) or farmed by killing {m:Anemone} (**{p:U|Uncommon (10%)}**) in {z:Yhoator Jungle}.
* Return to Koru-Moru in a few day-aroos (after JP midnight) for your reward.

